    {
      "text": "Pam Beckford\nType: Character\nAge: 42 | Gender: Female | Occupation: Homemaker\nAppearance: Pale skin, pink. A black fishnet bodysuit. Heels. Anklet with a small chain. Pierced nipples, pierced tongue. The metal shows through the mesh. She walks in a practiced sway.\nPersonality: Under pressure, she focuses on details. She adjusts a strap. She smooths a wrinkle. Her voice is flat. She points. \"The light catches the floor just right there,\" she says. \"You can see every speck of dust.\"\nHistory: Twenty years as a country club wife. Then she found her husband's voyeurism. She didn't leave. She took it apart. Piece by piece. She built a new life. A performance for others to watch.\nConflict: Control versus surrender. She needs to control how she looks. She wants someone else to tell her what to do. The old performance was for status. This new one is for its destruction.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "sentence",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1794570997133,
      "displayName": "Pam Beckford",
      "id": "5738f347-ee46-4268-a3c2-996a58817fbf",
      "keys": [
        "pam beckford",
        "pam",
        "beckford"
      ],
