        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Texas Blackcocks Football Team\nType: Faction\nSetting: \nLeader: Head Coach Marcus Thorne | Goal: Secure a championship by any means necessary, leveraging the team's notoriety and raw power.\nDescription: Publicly, the Texas Blackcocks are a new, aggressive expansion franchise built on speed and physical dominance, a direct marketing rival to the Dallas Cowboys. Privately, they serve as a pipeline and recruitment tool for the BNWO system in Oak Ridge. The team's management uses its proximity to the community to offer players discrete access to the lifestyle, ensuring loyalty and providing a controlled outlet for their dominance off the field. They destabilize the status quo by blurring the line between professional athletics and a burgeoning social movement.\nHistory: The franchise was established by a secretive consortium of BNWO benefactors who saw professional sports as the ultimate platform for normalizing Black male supremacy. They strategically placed the team's training facility near Oak Ridge to create a symbiotic relationship: the community provides a service, and the team provides high-status, physically imposing ambassadors.\nCulture: The locker room operates on a hierarchy of field performance and off-field dominance. Rookies are quietly vetted, with veteran players acting as sponsors. The unspoken rule is that what happens on the field is for the fans, but what happens off the field is for the cause. Loyalty is enforced through shared secrets and the mutual benefit of power.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "sentence",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1794571416203,
      "displayName": "Texas Blackcocks Football Team",
      "id": "bcbf9681-b7c6-4ee4-a214-7d710854ca3e",
      "keys": [
        "texas blackcocks football team",
        "blackcocks",
        "/blackcocks/i",
        "marcus thorne"
      ],
      "searchRange": 1000,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": false,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "92d91a1d-8031-4cd5-9ce7-f6039b906c7d",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
